WEBVTT

00:00.188 --> 00:01.225
Hello, Zcash community!

00:01.342 --> 00:04.112
Today we’ll use the Vizor
desktop app to vote.

00:04.238 --> 00:04.738
Let’s get started.

00:05.045 --> 00:08.318
This proposal would wind
down ZCG and end new grants.

00:08.838 --> 00:10.292
Grants already awarded would continue,

00:10.458 --> 00:13.378
with payments made as
agreed milestones are met.

00:13.665 --> 00:16.245
After covering existing
grants and wind-down costs,

00:16.525 --> 00:20.192
remaining funds would go to the Future
Dev and Legal Defense Fund lockbox.

00:20.798 --> 00:24.858
If ZCG’s 8% funding stream is still
active when the upgrade takes effect,

00:25.152 --> 00:28.565
it would go to that lockbox
until the November 2028 halving.

00:29.067 --> 00:33.737
This proposal would redirect ZCG’s 8%
funding stream to a new Future Dev and

00:33.750 --> 00:38.045
Legal Defense Fund lockbox requiring
community approval for disbursements,

00:38.272 --> 00:42.626
require ZCG to contribute
50,000 ZEC to the NSM,

00:42.639 --> 00:46.906
and preserve ZCG and its grant
program with its remaining treasury.

00:47.400 --> 00:52.467
This proposal would retain ZCG’s
existing treasury and continue its 8%

00:52.480 --> 00:54.647
funding stream through November 2028.

00:55.280 --> 00:59.580
It would rename the grant program and
its pool of funds to Zcash Adoption

00:59.593 --> 01:04.107
Pool, consistent with using those funds
to increase Zcash and ZEC adoption

01:04.293 --> 01:05.467
as broadly as possible.

01:05.880 --> 01:09.553
It would also leave open the possibility
of using funds from the existing

01:09.567 --> 01:12.400
treasury for development
and legal defense.

01:12.912 --> 01:14.592
This is the status quo option.

01:14.958 --> 01:19.892
ZCG would continue receiving its 8%
funding stream through the November 2028

01:19.992 --> 01:23.358
halving, and its treasury and
operations would remain unchanged.

01:23.933 --> 01:26.300
Assuming it can be done
safely in a network upgrade,

01:26.553 --> 01:29.940
do you support reducing Zcash’s target
block time from 25 seconds to 20

01:29.953 --> 01:30.340
seconds?

01:31.320 --> 01:31.907
Ready to vote?

01:33.405 --> 01:35.435
Open Vizor and unlock your wallet.

01:37.280 --> 01:38.347
Choose Vote in the sidebar,

01:38.360 --> 01:39.300
then open the poll.

01:40.260 --> 01:42.527
Take a moment to read each
proposal and make your choices.

01:43.047 --> 01:44.947
When you’re ready, click Review answers.

01:45.527 --> 01:46.627
Give them one last look,

01:46.900 --> 01:48.347
then click Confirm and submit.

01:49.128 --> 01:51.285
Leave Vizor open while it finishes.

01:51.580 --> 01:52.540
See that green Voted badge?

01:52.800 --> 01:53.313
You’re all set.

01:54.420 --> 01:56.467
Your vote helps shape the future of Zcash.

01:56.853 --> 01:57.493
Happy voting.
